---
interface Props {
  cluster?: string;
  compact?: boolean;
}
const { cluster = 'pricing', compact = false } = Astro.props;
const botLink = `https://t.me/oblepiha_vpn_bot?start=seo_${cluster}`;
---

<section class:list={["scroll-mt-20", compact ? "py-10" : "px-4 py-16 lg:py-24"]} id="pricing">
  <div class="mb-10 flex flex-col gap-3 text-center">
    <p class="text-sm font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-accent">Честные условия</p>
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-primary md:text-5xl">Выберите свой комфорт</h2>
    <p class="text-base text-primary/70 md:text-lg">Одна подписка — до 5 устройств, без ограничений по объёму трафика</p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 items-stretch gap-6 md:grid-cols-3 lg:gap-8">
    <article class="flex flex-col rounded-[2.5rem] border-2 border-primary/5 bg-card p-8 shadow-sm transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-accent/30">
      <div class="mb-6 flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <span class="text-xl font-bold text-primary">Пробный</span>
        <span class="text-3xl font-black text-primary">10 ₽</span>
      </div>
      <p class="mb-10 text-base leading-relaxed text-primary/60">3 дня полного доступа. Проверьте скорость и подключите свои устройства без большой оплаты.</p>
      <a href={botLink} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-seo-cta data-cluster={cluster} data-position="pricing_trial" data-offer="trial" class="focus-ring mt-auto flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-primary/5 py-4 font-bold text-primary transition-all hover:bg-accent hover:text-white">Попробовать за 10 ₽</a>
    </article>

    <article class="relative z-10 flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[3rem] border-4 border-accent bg-primary p-8 shadow-2xl md:scale-[1.04]">
      <span class="absolute right-0 top-0 rounded-bl-2xl bg-accent px-6 py-2 text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-white">Популярный</span>
      <div class="mb-6 mt-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">1 месяц</span>
        <span class="text-4xl font-black text-accent">199 ₽</span>
      </div>
      <p class="mb-10 text-base leading-relaxed text-white/60">Подключайте до 5 устройств одновременно. Управление подпиской и поддержка находятся в Telegram-боте.</p>
      <a href={botLink} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-seo-cta data-cluster={cluster} data-position="pricing_month" data-offer="monthly" class="focus-ring mt-auto flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-accent py-5 text-lg font-black text-white shadow-lg transition-all hover:brightness-110">Подключить</a>
    </article>

    <article class="flex flex-col rounded-[2.5rem] border-2 border-primary/5 bg-card p-8 shadow-sm transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-accent/30">
      <div class="mb-6 flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <span class="text-xl font-bold text-primary">3 месяца</span>
        <span class="text-3xl font-black text-primary">549 ₽</span>
      </div>
      <p class="mb-10 text-base leading-relaxed text-primary/60">Выгодный вариант для постоянного использования: все возможности сервиса и пять устройств.</p>
      <a href={botLink} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-seo-cta data-cluster={cluster} data-position="pricing_quarter" data-offer="quarterly" class="focus-ring mt-auto flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-primary/5 py-4 font-bold text-primary transition-all hover:bg-accent hover:text-white">Выбрать тариф</a>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
